{"id":"Wadaf150753df268e7af8260d","zh":"轮轨界面","en":"","name":"轮轨界面","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wadaf150753df268e7af8260d","text":"轮轨界面","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S661c8c937e256ebe7a75","source_id":"P117","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"方法以轮轨界面的低动力相互作用优化为基础,采用分层设计思路,将车轨系统参数分为两两一组,进行不同参数匹配下的系统动力行为考察;另外,采用权重系数方法定量分析不同设计层中的系统参数对优化目标的影响程度。","citations":[{"source_id":"P117","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S2341952c3106ac61bf03","source_id":"P117","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"一般而言,此系统的动力响应来源于轮轨界面的能量输入,此能量从轮轨界面出发,分别向上、下分层传递,从而引起车辆系统和轨道系统的动力响应,所以实现此系统低动力设计的基础,是降低轮轨动态相互作用。","citations":[{"source_id":"P117","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P117":{"id":"P117","title":"用于车辆-轨道系统参数优化的分层设计与权重组合方法","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2019","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2019.05.022","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-multi-layer-design-and-weight-method-for-parameter-optimization-of-vehicle-track-system"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"连接车辆和轨道、传递动力作用的接触界面。","language":"zh","source_id":"P117","paper_slug":"2019-multi-layer-design-and-weight-method-for-parameter-optimization-of-vehicle-track-system","title":"用于车辆-轨道系统参数优化的分层设计与权重组合方法","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wb0be18f15603f465e7af6380","name":"Wheel-rail interface","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wb0be18f15603f465e7af6380","name":"Wheel-rail interface","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wb0be18f15603f465e7af6380","name":"Whee